{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新空いちゃってごめんね/ _ ;\n毎日せかせかと動かせて\nもらっていました∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのblogに書いてある\nヘリコブターってなんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとヘリコプターの間違いヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近覚えたって言ってたけど\n結局まだ間違えてるじゃんか〜っ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのブログに\n突っ込んだついでに\n他の子のブログの話もしよう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私メンバーのblogを読むのが\n日課なので更新されたら割と\n早めにチェックしてる方なのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あっ♪もちろん二期生ちゃん達の\nblogもしっかり読んでるので\nこれを読んだ二期生ちゃん達は\n盛大にまなったんのことをblogで\n褒めてくれてもいいんだよー♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、なのですが\n普段くっつきにいくと\nすごい速さで逃げようとする\nかずみんがメンバーの中で\n彼女にするなら真夏！と\n言ってくれてたの〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きまして若月blog"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようやくジャケ写も公開して\n制服姿を載せられる時期に\nなったのですがそれと同時に\n若月周辺でブームを巻き起こした\n壁ドンの写メがあがってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りは番外編の\n真夏×美彩の壁ドン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しいことに私が男側！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"案外アリじゃないですか(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだおまえ〜！\n答えないと..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チューしちゃうぞっ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パクッ♪♪(ん...ましゅまろだ♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて先日、\nまいやん・いこたん・りんごさん\nなぁちゃん・玲香・若月・真夏の\n7人でHTC J butterflyの\nキャンペーンをしに台湾へ\n行って来ました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初台湾♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介も中国語でしたのヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空港に着いた瞬間、\nよくテレビのニュースで\n流れているような感じで\nカメラや現地のファンの方に\n温かく迎えていただいて\n芸能人になった気分を\n味わえましたヽ(〃v〃)ﾉきゃ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾のHTCの店頭で\nHTCの機能をお客さんに\n知っていただいたり、\n抽選で当たった方に直接\nHTCを手渡しさせて\nもらったりもしたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小籠包・海鮮・火鍋・タピオカ\n有名なサンドイッチなどなど\nたくさん美味しいものも\n食べられて幸せでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初台湾だったのに私の名前を\n知ってくれている方もいて\nすごく嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリのジャパンエキスポに引き続き\n台湾でもライブやイベントを\nできるように頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾のみなさん\n待っててね〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火鍋のお店に猫の置物が\n置いてあったんだけど\nそれを見て玲香とかが\n真夏みたいなのいる！って\n言ってきたから強気で\n反論するつもりが\n見てみたら思いのほか\nその猫と私の笑った時の顔が\n似てて納得してしまった...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃニャンちゅう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきね、今月発売のUTBの\n本になる前の写真を一足先に\n見せてもらったんだけど\n一つ一つすごく私が好きな\n雰囲気の写真になってました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとUTBさん\nいつも綺麗で好きーっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売をお楽しみにヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今発売中の季刊乃木坂 涼秋に\n出させてもらってます(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涼秋ってなんか美しい...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴロン♡してみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織も今回の季刊乃木坂に\n載ってるんだけど撮影中に\nマネージャーさんから\nこんな写メが送られてきた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりんもみなさんのハートに〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっきゅん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏:あれ？倒れちゃってどうしたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人:...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏:私も隣で寝ていい？♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人:...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏:ねぇ、お尻見せてないで\n何か喋ってよぉーーっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/08/7011394/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人:...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、季刊乃木坂オフショット\nお気に入りの銅像との\n妄想会話でした♪笑"}],"source":"archive"}